# Custom confirmations only

Never use `window.confirm()`, `confirm()`, `window.alert()`, or `alert()` in frontend code.

Every destructive action (`router.delete`, remove, disconnect that destroys data) must go through `@/Components/ConfirmProvider`:

```js
import { confirmAsk } from '@/Components/ConfirmProvider';

const ok = await confirmAsk({
  title: 'Delete this funnel?',
  message: 'Optional detail',
  confirmLabel: 'Delete',
  tone: 'danger', // or 'default'
});
if (ok) {
  router.delete(...);
}
```

String shorthand: `await confirmAsk('Remove this file?')`
